    "detailed_description": "&quot;Florida's a wasteland. A testament to the world's collapse. You've been condemned - sentenced to die in a spectacle of car combat. You might not remember better times, but prisoner, I see potential...&quot;<br><br>A throwback from the classic car combat era, set in a post-apocalyptic sunny south Florida! Wreckage exists in an alternate timeline where Lead-based gasoline was not banned, and crime waves decimated the sunshine state. From the opening crawl you are a prisoner, condemned to die by car combat. You escape the stadium and into the crowds. And from there, who knows...<br><br><strong>Game modes:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Singleplayer driver campaigns<br></li><li> Roguelite co-op mode for 1-4 players<br></li><li> Challenge mode<br></li><li> Versus mode</li></ul><br><strong>Features:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Twisted Metal in Florida!!<br></li><li> Old school visuals, updated controls<br></li><li> Fast-paced arcade &quot;Car brawler&quot;<br></li><li> 9+ Florida drivers<br></li><li> 21+ real destructible Florida locations<br></li><li> 50+ weapon attachments and upgrades<br></li><li> Rioting pedestrian hordes armed to the teeth<br></li><li> Rich overworld story exploring the Lead-crime Hypothesis</li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Comic book style cutscenes</li></ul><br><strong>Roadmap:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Coming soon...</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444530/extras/f854c7773d23f48428d979baacd2f1e4.avif?t=1726538790\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2444530/extras/87c9002943ac624aa3147cc135891702.avif?t=1726538790\" /></span>",
